FIELDS:["A Meal Along the Road: A Food Shop in Joseon Korea #KoreanHistory","What can a meal on the road tell us about daily life in Korea?\nUnder a thatched roof, people prepare and sell food. Bowls sit close to customers, while a carrier balances a broad tray on her head.\n\nThe exact dishes and type of shop cannot be identified from this picture alone. Follow the hands preparing food and the body carrying it: an unfamiliar shop becomes a place of familiar human effort.\n\nCollection item: APKC260507306 · genre painting attributed to Uncho\nFrom the TJ Kim Collection\nMusic: Flow Music, \"윷판의 웃음\" (AI-generated music)\nVisuals: drawing animation and AI cleanup based on a collection image\n\n#KoreanHistory #Joseon #FoodHistory #KoreanCulture #TJKimCollection"]
