FIELDS:["A Rainy Day in Joseon Korea: Hats, Covers and Everyday Life #KoreanHistory","Rain changes a street, but it does not stop the day.\nSome people shelter under a roof while others keep moving. Look at the broad hats and the covers over a carried load: clothing and everyday tools become ways to deal with the weather.\n\nBeyond the unfamiliar shapes are people working, resting and getting somewhere. This genre painting brings a rainy Korean street a little closer.\n\nCollection item: APKC260507306 · genre painting attributed to Uncho\nFrom the TJ Kim Collection\nMusic: Flow Music, \"먹빛의 밤\" (AI-generated music)\nVisuals: drawing animation and AI cleanup based on a collection image\n\n#KoreanHistory #Joseon #KoreanCulture #ClothingHistory #TJKimCollection"]
